{"duration_api_ms":138731,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"03f082c0-cd71-4b0f-a57f-3bd39c27b930","total_cost_usd":0.19626800000000003,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15951,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":13246,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":8559},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15951,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":13246,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15951,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15951},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":13246,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":15951,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.19626800000000003,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":8559,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"The front is a one-dimensional gamma sweep at the corner D~3.384, bluntness 1.2, cone 70. Along it, flux runs from 227k W/m2 (gamma -1.5) to 275k (gamma -3.57) and bondline T from 417.9 K to 391.1 K. Every other variable is pinned by a limit: D by heatshield mass fraction (margin ~0 at D~3.385), cone at its 70 deg bound, bluntness by the aero-surrogate hull and geometry limit near b=1.2, and gamma by max_g=12 near -3.57. Round 2 (20 geometry failures) shows the danger of leaving this corner, so I stay on it and fill gaps and push the edges.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-636b6aeca4e0 (gamma -3.57, g 11.999) and C-4176038753c7 (-3.568) sit at the g limit, so the steep end of the front is g-limited.\",\"C-4141cc258747 (D 3.385, mass margin 1.4e-4) and C-636b6aeca4e0 (D 3.384, margin 7.4e-4) give a margin slope of about 5.9e-4 per mm of D, so the D cap is ~3.3852.\",\"C-099cae65259a (b 1.1), C-8efdd90862a0 (b 1.15, cone 69) and C-26610a6c01d5 (b 1.0, cone 68) violate mass fraction and have higher flux and T than b 1.2, cone 70, so lower b or cone is worse.\",\"C-de929f2046c9, C-207a027e9dd5, C-4d9cd4c2b38d (b 1.205-1.22) fail hull extrapolation, and C-f986776067bd, C-9c1cc1a27672 (b 1.3-1.35) fail geometry, so b cannot exceed ~1.2.\",\"C-114b79b08144 (D 3.2, b 1.1, gamma -3.7) has T 393.8 K and is g-infeasible, so smaller D costs T and buys little g.\"],\"mechanism\":\"Flux falls with nose radius (b*D/2) and with lower ballistic coefficient (larger D). T falls with a shorter, steeper entry pulse and with larger D. g is set almost entirely by gamma, at roughly 1.66 g/deg, with only a weak dependence on D. The feasible optimum therefore lies at the D, b and cone bounds, and the front is traced by gamma from -1.5 to -3.57. Extra hypervolume can only come from filling gaps between existing gamma points and from tiny D increases up to the mass cap (about 0.02% in flux). This rests partly on prior knowledge of the ~1/sqrt(Rn) heating scaling, which I did not check against the data.\",\"uncertainty\":\"Interpolated flux and T values along gamma are accurate to a few hundred W/m2 and about 0.3 K. The D=3.3851-3.3852 points sit within 1e-4 of the mass-fraction limit and the gamma=-3.568 points within 4e-4 of the g limit, so they may flip to infeasible if the margin is slightly nonlinear. Gains are small because the front is essentially converged, and some proposed gammas may duplicate rows not shown to me.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the shallow-end gap between gamma -1.5 and -1.75 on the D 3.384, b 1.2, cone 70 corner.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.62},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":229700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":415.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds a non-dominated point on the smooth part of the front, which slightly improves the staircase hypervolume.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap close to the shallow extreme.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":228320,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.1,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies coverage near the lowest-flux end of the trade-off.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -1.75 and -1.9.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.83},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":234030,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":412.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Interpolated non-dominated point that adds coverage.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.0 and -2.3.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.15},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":241075,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":407.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills a 0.3 deg gap in the middle of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.3 and -2.5.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.43},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":247480,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":404.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the mid-front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -2.5 and -2.7.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.62},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":251940,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":401.55,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the mid-front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the largest gap, between gamma -2.7 and -3.0.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.83},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":256920,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":399.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"This gap is the widest on the front, so a point here has the most hypervolume to add.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.0 and -3.1.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.05},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":262190,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the steep-mid part of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.1 and -3.35.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.22},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":266290,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.65,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Covers a 0.25 deg gap.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the same 0.25 deg gap at a second gamma. The neighbouring -3.3 point was at D 3.375 and is dominated, so a D 3.384 point here is new.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.28},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":267735,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.0,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Improves the front locally at full D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.5 and -3.55.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.52},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273490,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the steep end, where each K of T is worth most.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.55 and -3.57, with g about 11.98, safely feasible.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.56},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274445,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Adds a point near the g-limited corner.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.5 and -3.55.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.545},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274085,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.35,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the corner; the point is cheap and safe.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma -3.55 and -3.566 near the g cap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.562},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274490,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.18,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Densifies the extreme steep end.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-4176038753c7\",\"rationale\":\"Raise D by 0.1 mm to 3.3851, just inside the mass cap (predicted margin ~8.7e-5), at the g-limited corner. Flux and T should drop marginally.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3851,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.568},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274630,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.13,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests whether a tiny D increase dominates the current corner points, and probes the mass-fraction boundary precisely.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-385f3798bd45\",\"rationale\":\"Push D to 3.3852 (predicted margin ~3e-5) at gamma -3.56 to test the mass cap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3852,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.56},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274440,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.2,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"high\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Locates the exact D ceiling. If the point is feasible, it is a tiny improvement.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.3851 at gamma -3.5 to test a marginal improvement in the mid-steep region.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3851},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":272980,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.79,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks the sensitivity of flux and T to a 0.1 mm change in D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.3851 at the shallow extreme gamma -1.5, to slightly improve the lowest-flux end of the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3851,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":227290,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.9,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"May dominate the current gamma -1.5 point, which is the lowest-flux end of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-6ffb6b7edb43\",\"rationale\":\"D=3.3851 at mid-front gamma -2.5 to test whether the small D increase dominates in the middle of the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.3851,\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":249070,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":403.05,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks that the D benefit holds across gamma.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0}]}","ttft_ms":99666,"type":"result","duration_ms":138806,"uuid":"aee84578-df96-4183-8730-747a79c9a4f3","ttft_stream_ms":1686,"time_to_request_ms":73,"first_content_frame_ms":1687,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
